# Muzzle environment variables.
#
# BYOK is the default: users supply their own provider key at runtime from the
# Settings panel; it is stored in their browser and sent per-request to the
# relay endpoints. The variables below are an OPTIONAL server-side fallback for
# a built-in metered option (PRD D3 / risk mitigation).
#
# Hard rule: provider keys are server-only. NEVER prefix these with PUBLIC_.
# Pull real values locally with `vercel env pull .env` — do not commit secrets.

# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
